M2     -.->|"⑦ OTLP spans (OTEL_ENABLED)"| OTC
WRK    -.->|"⑦ OTLP spans"| OTC
M2     -.->|"⑦ stdout JSON logs"| PTL
WRK    -.->|"⑦ stdout JSON logs"| PTL
